This repository contains build configuration, patches, scripts and
documentation for producing a customized Batocera Linux image ("the
Project").

1. The Project is provided for personal use only. You may build the
   image for your own use and modify these files for that purpose.

2. Public redistribution of the produced disk image is not permitted,
   in particular because it combines components under several third-party
   licenses. Redistribute the upstream components from their official
   sources instead.

3. No warranty. The Project is provided "as is", without warranty of any
   kind, express or implied. The author is not liable for any damage,
   data loss or hardware issue resulting from its use, including from
   writing images to storage devices.

4. Third-party components keep their own licenses and copyrights:
   - Batocera Linux and its build system
   - Buildroot
   - RetroArch and the libretro-puae core
   - the Linux kernel and all bundled packages
   Nothing in this file grants or restricts any right over those
   components.

5. Amiga Kickstart ROMs and any Amiga software are NOT part of this
   repository and are NOT covered by this license. They remain the
   property of their respective right holders (Kickstart: Cloanto).
   Obtain them legally (for example via Amiga Forever).
